abstract: >-
  An Arabic and English evidence-led dossier on how ambiguous mental or
  physical symptoms can move through family fear, premature certainty,
  authority transfer and consent erosion to delay or harm. It proposes the
  Fear–Certainty–Authority Cascade and the Parallel-Path Safeguard as
  explicitly non-validated analytical syntheses.
keywords:
  - diagnostic uncertainty
  - diagnostic safety
  - family decision-making
  - coercion
  - informed consent
  - mental health
  - spiritual support
  - help-seeking
